      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Totally for this! I'm in a position as well where you have so many friends in a world together at once that the blocking avatars option doesn't bring me any performance gain anymore. Blocking avatars based on proximity to randoms AND friends would be a huge help to boost performance for us.",
