      "value": "Thank you for your request!\n\nVRChat 2022.2.2p3 introduced the Avatar Distance Hider. It allows you to hide avatars that are far away.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202222p3\n\nPlease let us know if you have any other feedback. Thank you for playing VRChat.",
